3,0.6024048416702835,0.19005969624500796,0.025931464301215276],"origin":[0.05551091167505203,0.6231500131112558],"font":"MicrosoftYaHei-Bold","size":14.003000259399414,"resolvedFamily":"Microsoft YaHei"},{"anchor":"text-52","text":"高素质的人才队伍是事业单位发展的根本保障。要注重人才培养，完善培","box":[0.05551091167505203,0.6470133463541666,0.33398319769569124,0.018529595269097223],"origin":[0.05551091167505203,0.6618370338722511],"font":"MicrosoftYaHei","size":10.005999565124512,"resolvedFamily":"Microsoft YaHei"},{"anchor":"text-53","text":"训机制，打造一支政治过硬、业务精通的高素质专业化队伍。他建议我们","box":[0.05551091167505203,0.6736800017180267,0.33398319769569124,0.018529595269097223],"origin":[0.05551091167505203,0.6885036892361112],"font":"MicrosoftYaHei","size":10.005999565124512,"resolvedFamily":"Microsoft YaHei"},{"anchor":"text-54","text":"可以与高校合作，建立人才培养基地，为单位持续输送新鲜血液。","box":[0.05551091167505203,0.7003467135959202,0.3008532916857267,0.018529595269097223],"origin":[0.05551091167505203,0.7151704011140047],"font":"MicrosoftYaHei","size":10.005999565124512,"resolvedFamily":"Microsoft YaHei"},{"anchor":"text-55","text":"推进改革创新，增强发展动力","box":[0.05551091167505203,0.772954813639323,0.19005969624500796,0.025931464301215276],"origin":[0.05551091167505203,0.7936999850802952],"font":"MicrosoftYaHei-Bold","size":14.003000259399414,"resolvedFamily":"Microsoft YaHei"},{"anchor":"text-56","text":"面对新时代的挑战，王书记要求我们要主动适应新形势新要求，深化内部","box":[0.05551091167505203,0.8175651832863137,0.3339831659068606,0.018529595269097223],"origin":[0.05551091167505203,0.8323888708043982],"font":"MicrosoftYaHei","size":10.005999565124512,"resolvedFamily":"Microsoft YaHei"},{"anchor":"text-57","text":"管理改革，优化业务流程，提高资源利用效率。他特别强调要充分运用信","box":[0.05551091167505203,0.8442318951642072,0.3339831659068606,0.018529595269097223],"origin":[0.05551091167505203,0.8590555826822917],"font":"MicrosoftYaHei","size":10.005999565124512,"resolvedFamily":"Microsoft YaHei"},{"anchor":"text-58","text":"息化手段，推动传统业务向智能化、数字化转型。","box":[0.05551091167505203,0.8708985505280671,0.2